From df8324b53e365332e090c6e68ff6e27a2c53a37d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "computer.angel" <computer.angel@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 13:56:29 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add VinCSS OIDC and OAuth2 connectors support

- Implemented a new OIDC connector for VinCSS with tests to validate the authentication flow.
- Created a fake OIDC provider for testing purposes, including handling discovery, JWKS, and token issuance.
- Added support for VinCSS OAuth2 as a sub-kind of the GitHub connector, allowing for custom endpoint configurations.
- Updated API server to include OIDC login routes and handlers.
- Documented the setup and usage of VinCSS connectors in vincss.readme.md.
- Enhanced error handling and logging for OIDC and OAuth2 processes.
